  "note": "The privacy boundary, stated once for both packages. node/tests/anonymize.test.ts and python/tests/test_anonymize.py both run every case here, so 'Node and Python behave identically' is checked rather than believed. `strip` cases assert what the heal API is shown; `strip_send_messages` cases assert the same with the caller's sendMessages / send_messages opt-in on, including Gemini contents; `merge` cases assert the body that gets replayed.",

  "strip": [
    {
      "name": "prompts, tools and system never travel; the settings do",
